**Modern way — built-in `.flat()`:**

```js
const arr = [[1, 2], [3, 4, 5], [6, 7]];
console.log(arr.flat());                    // [1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7]

// Deep nesting
const deep = [1, [2, [3, [4, [5]]]]];
